If a patient has an acute-pain then every clinician should appropriately assess the acute-pain and should appropriately treat the acute-pain.
If a patient has a subacute-pain then every clinician should appropriately assess the subacute-pain and should appropriately treat the subacute-pain.
If a patient has a chronic-pain then every clinician should appropriately assess the chronic-pain and should appropriately treat the chronic-pain.
